# --- NAT: Outbound source translation (overlay) ---
set device-group DG-AWS-COMBINED-OBEW pre-rulebase nat rules AWS-OUTBOUND source-translation dynamic-ip-and-port interface-address interface ethernet1/2
set device-group DG-AWS-COMBINED-OBEW pre-rulebase nat rules AWS-OUTBOUND target negate no
set device-group DG-AWS-COMBINED-OBEW pre-rulebase nat rules AWS-OUTBOUND to UNTRUST
