set device-group DG-AWS-COMBINED-OBEW pre-rulebase nat rules AWS-OUTBOUND destination any
set device-group DG-AWS-COMBINED-OBEW pre-rulebase nat rules AWS-OUTBOUND tag [ OUTBOUND OVERLAY-NAT ]
set device-group DG-AWS-COMBINED-OBEW pre-rulebase nat rules AWS-OUTBOUND service any
set device-group DG-AWS-COMBINED-OBEW pre-rulebase nat rules AWS-OUTBOUND to-interface ethernet1/2
set device-group DG-AWS-COMBINED-OBEW pre-rulebase nat rules AWS-OUTBOUND group-tag OUTBOUND

